<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<glyph name="uni00F0" format="2">
  <advance width="744"/>
  <unicode hex="00F0"/>
  <note>
New eth with independent upper arc and crossed ascending stroke.
Weight master: 正文粗体：竖茎 150、接合只到 132，锐角内收形成轻微墨阱，而不是把 Regular 撑圆。字距比半粗回松，避免字字粘连。R 的腿缩短、裆部打开。与 zayJu 粗体相比仍更克制、更宽。
</note>
